{% raw %}
ACCOUNT SECURITY ACTIVITY NOTIFICATION

Hello, {{ .DisplayName }},

This message is to inform you that a security-related action was performed on
your account, such as changing your password or authentication settings.

If you did not perform this action, your credentials may be compromised.
Change your password immediately and contact your administrator.

This notification was generated by a request from IP address {{ .RemoteIP }}.

